{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-wintery-watermelon","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Wintery Watermelon","description":"\u003cp\u003eWatermelon might typically be known as a sweet and juicy fruit, but VELO Wintery Watermelon nicotine pouches adds a slightly different dimension. It has a frosty flavor due to the inclusion of mint, which leaves a tingling sensation in the mouth that creates an icy experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs mini nicotine pouches, the products are smaller than traditional nicotine pouches, meaning they feel less intrusive in the mouth — useful for consumers who don’t want others to notice their pouches or anyone seeking an ergonomic experience. They’re also lightweight, weighing just 0.5 g each.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWintery Watermelon Flavour Pouches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mg \u0026amp; 10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41801876013111,"sku":"VELO - Wintery Watermelon","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-wintery-watermelon-nicotine-pouches.webp?v=1753916506","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/velo-nicotine-pouches-wintery-watermelon","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




